2 CONT Caspar Forbes was a student at Uppsala university in 1651. Confer [SSNE 310]  Andersson et al, Uppsala Universitets Matrikel, (Uppsala, 1900-1911); T. Fischer, The Scots in Sweden (Edinburgh, 1907), Supplement, pp.215-267.
